  {
   "block": "explain",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "figures": {},
     "literals": [],
     "text": "Debt exclusions, which raise the levy outside the limit. The state’s vote file used here carries overrides only."
    },
    {
     "figures": {},
     "literals": [
      "FY1994",
      "FY1997",
      "FY2025"
     ],
     "text": "Overrides passed for FY1994, FY1997, FY2025. Each raises the levy, and so the rate, in its year; the table marks them."
    },
    {
     "figures": {},
     "literals": [],
     "text": "Our existing-value line also absorbs revaluation, abatements and class shifts, which the state’s files do not separate from market change."
    }
   ],
   "place": "end",
   "title": "What this page does not separate",
