    },
    "literals": [],
    "text": "Development that year was 2.73% of the base, against 1.87% in a typical year; the fall in the rate tracks the 22.3% rise in existing values."
   },
   "text": "In FY2003 existing values rose 22.3% and the rate fell 15.9%; development added 2.73%."
  },
  {
   "figures": {
